{"id":"u-fab6d104-edfa-4cf3-ab3a-47edf1578ac6","src":"community","title":"Forge Mode: 12-Week Mass Protocol","author":"aelun  K.","url":"https://www.boostcamp.app/users/t4BZ42-untitled-program","desc":"This 12-week muscle-building programme is designed to maximise muscle growth, develop strength and build a powerful, well-balanced physique.\n\nTraining four days per week, the programme combines heavy compound lifts with targeted hypertrophy exercises to stimulate muscle growth across all major muscle groups, with extra emphasis on the chest, back, shoulders and arms.\n\nWeekly Training Split:\n\n- Day 1 – Upper Heavy: Focuses on building upper-body strength and size through heavy pressing, rowing and targeted arm exercises.\n- Day 2 – Lower + Accessories: Develops leg strength and muscle mass while adding extra work for the rear delts, biceps, triceps and abs.\n- Day 3 – Upper Hypertrophy: Prioritises upper-body muscle growth through controlled movements, moderate-to-high repetitions and increased training volume.\n- Day 4 – Lower + Upper Pump: Combines lower-body development with additional chest, back, shoulder and arm exercises for balanced growth.\n\nEach workout takes approximately 90 minutes and uses a combination of barbells, dumbbells, cables and machines.\n\nThe programme follows a repeating weekly structure over 12 weeks, allowing you to progressively increase weights, repetitions and overall performance as you become stronger.\n\nDesigned for intermediate lifters, this programme is ideal for anyone looking to gain muscle mass, improve strength and build a bigger, more muscular physique through consistent, structured training.","level":["Intermediate"],"goals":["Muscle"],"equipment":["Full Gym"],"minutes":90,"joins":1,"rate":0,"rateCount":0,"updated":"2026-10-25T22:26:29.448Z","variations":[{"name":"default","days":["Upper Heavy","Lower + accessories","Upper Hypertrophy","Lower + Upper Pump"],"weeks":[[{"ex":[{"n":"Bench Press (Barbell)","sets":[{"r":8,"x"